  ChargeRate | doc "How fast a charge fills, its points per second as the game's `f32` holds them (a master's\n`recharge_rate`); over [`Seconds`] it is a [`Charge`]. Each operator is the one `f32`\noperation the game does, in its order." = Number,
  ChargeTarget | doc "A master's charge targets (`charge_target`, `+0x924`): one bit per group of classes its charge\nworks on (`FUN_1412623d0`); every bit (−1) works on every object, none (0) on every object but\nbuildings. Every short is kept." = std.contract.from_predicate (fun x => std.is_number x && x % 1 == 0 && -32768 <= x && x <= 32767),
