  Frame | doc "A frame of a sprite (a short): the frame a sprite shows (`+0x24`) and showed before\n(`+0x30`), a graphic's frame count (`frame_count`, `+0x8`, one past its last frame), a\nmaster's fire and interrupt frames and the frame a BUILD command chose. Each operator is the\ngame's 16-bit one; every value is kept." = std.contract.from_predicate (fun x => std.is_number x && x % 1 == 0 && -32768 <= x && x <= 32767),
