  GhostMode | doc "A master's `create_doppelganger_on_death` (`+0x682`): whether its dying objects leave ghosts in\nthe other players' fog. Every byte is kept; only 2 leaves them." = std.contract.from_predicate (fun x => std.is_number x && x % 1 == 0 && 0 <= x && x <= 255),
